cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Parkinson's voice biomarkers with subject-grouped cross-validation"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Also cite the UCI
  Parkinsons dataset and the papers that introduced the voice measures.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sarkar
