url: "https://github.com/Ishitta-Sarkar/parkinsons-voice-biomarker-ml"
abstract: >-
  Subject-grouped cross-validation of sustained-phonation features for
  separating people with Parkinson's disease from healthy controls in the
  UCI Parkinsons recordings, reported against a majority-class baseline.
keywords:
  - Parkinson disease
  - voice biomarkers
  - subject-grouped cross-validation
  - UCI Parkinsons
